            "title": "Philip Morris: Growing Earnings Support A Growing Dividend",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"January 15, 2020, Monchegorsk, Russia. Gold IQOS electronic cigarette on a dark background, Marlboro and Philippe Morris iqos, which is described as a hybrid cigarette between analog and electronic\" data-id=\"1199672814\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"3561\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1199672814/image_1199672814.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1199672814/image_1199672814.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1199672814/image_1199672814.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1199672814/image_1199672814.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1199672814/image_1199672814.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1199672814/image_1199672814.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1199672814/image_1199672814.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1199672814/image_1199672814.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1199672814/image_1199672814.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"5177\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">Tatyana Berkovich/iStock Editorial via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <p>Where can I find a decent, safe yield with robust growth, you ask? My answer is look no further than Philip Morris International Inc. (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrappe