            "title": "Rocket Lab's Core Business Makes The Neutron Gamble Worth Taking",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Rocket Lab’s Neutron Production Complex, Wallops Island, Virginia (&lt;a href='https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/USA' title='Liberty All-Star Equity Fund'&gt;USA&lt;/a&gt;)\" data-id=\"2110143509\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2110143509/image_2110143509.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2110143509/image_2110143509.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2110143509/image_2110143509.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2110143509/image_2110143509.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2110143509/image_2110143509.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2110143509/image_2110143509.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2110143509/image_2110143509.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2110143509/image_2110143509.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2110143509/image_2110143509.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">John M. Chase/iStock Unreleased via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <h2>Elevator Thesis</h2> <p>Rocket Lab Corporation (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/RKLB\" title=\"Rocket Lab Corporation\">RKLB</a></span>) is evolving from a small launch company to something big.</p> <p>SpaceX (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SPCX\" title=\"Space Exploration Technologies Corp.\">SPCX</a>) remains the leader of the launch market while Northrop Grumman Corporation (</p></body></html>",
